{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">香港有七條專營巴士線前往皇崗口岸港方口岸區，其中三條由九巴營運。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">九巴公布三條線服務時間，來往葵翠邨與皇崗口岸的B10線，途徑青衣及大欖隧道轉車站，每早六點開出，尾班車於凌晨零時30分。平均車程約45分鐘。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.KMB-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T15JkQCUho1791522608.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER.KMB-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">來往天水圍、元朗，至皇崗口岸的B11路線，天富開出的班次，由早上5時服務至凌晨零時。而皇崗口岸開出的頭班車是早上6時，凌晨1時開出尾班車。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.KMB-1300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262WcRpTnq7p1791522620.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER.KMB-1300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">至於往沙田的通宵線NB73，晚上11點半起於皇崗口岸開出，沙田開出的頭班車就於凌晨零時開始，尾班車同樣於清晨5點半開出。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T05:19:01.734278+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}